{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111280","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1311128001:1":{"text":"あなたは、お花ですか？","source_cn":"呀，你是一朵花？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA189A6B700269B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311128002:1":{"text":"はい。お、驚かせてしまったのなら、申し訳ありません……","source_cn":"嗯，抱歉，我是不是吓到客人了……请您原谅……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDB0A0C8D1DADB26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311128003:1":{"text":"僕は、この荘園に咲いたサイレンシアです。子爵様からこの体と、考える能力を頂いたのです……","source_cn":"我是……是生长在这座庄园里的永寂花，子爵先生用魔法为我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD51204A597E92DEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311128004:1":{"text":"すごい魔法ですね！ここで何のお仕事をしているのですか？","source_cn":"这是很高深的魔法！你平常在庄园里负责什么事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3A875408D14E33A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311128005:1":{"text":"ぼ、僕は子爵様がお使いになる画材や道具の管理と、作品の保管を任されています。","source_cn":"我……负责管理子爵先生的绘画材料和工具，还有……还有画...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FF2DD2465AF5778","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311128006:1":{"text":"ただ、絵画は時間が経つとどうしても劣化してしまうのです……","source_cn":"可惜，有许多漂亮的画都无法对抗时间的侵蚀，已经腐朽了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F24C1789E9DC7EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311128007:1":{"text":"なぜ子爵様は美しい絵たちに魔法を付与せず、朽ちるがままにしているのでしょうか……","source_cn":"我不明白，子爵先生为什么不肯为它们附魔，而是任由这些精...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DC662A21BA648FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311128008:1":{"text":"僕は頭が良くないので、子爵様の考えが分かりません……","source_cn":"啊，我太笨了，总是无法理解子爵先生的想法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B3DA03A86FF3FE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奇花侍者":{"text":"サイレンシアの召使い","source":"奇花侍者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}